        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/498917?u=168bc3756bda2c1e4962b687bed0c85f18902638&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">It is defined by HTML and is related to contenteditable: <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#making-entire-documents-editable:-the-designmode-idl-attribute\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#making-entire-documents-editable:-the-designmode-idl-attribute</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It's not clear if it should be part of the contenteditable feature, so just untag it for now.</p>",
